<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">We have received your request to extend your current or recent temporary loan modification due to the Covid-19 pandemic.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><ul style=""><li style=""><font style=""><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please provide your&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Case.Last_Month__c}&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">bank statement and your&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!Case.Current_Month__c}</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;month to date transaction history for extension to be considered</span></div></font></li></ul></div></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial" style="">Please reply to this email with all the requested information and attachments. Once received, our team will review and a credit manager will respond as soon as possible*. We wish you and your family the best during this difficult time. Visit our site for updates and support for our customers:</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Email_Website_Address__c}</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span class="MsoHyperlink">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background: white;">Modification Department&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background: white;"><br></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: medium;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>